{"step_index":104,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:19:21Z","thinking":"**Investigating Execution Restrictions**\n\nI'm currently dealing with an execution policy restriction on Windows when running commands. I've pinpointed a media file, specifically `media_1787717941080.jpg`, located at `C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/.user_uploaded/media_17`. I need to figure out how this impacts the command execution.\n\n\n**Analyzing Image and Design**\n\nI've shifted focus to the image loading and design aspects. I'm exploring direct embedding versus file path references in `index.html`. The user feedback is to add more color and vibrancy, making the visuals richer and more colorful, matching the uploaded backgrounds. Now, I'm designing immersive backdrops in `index.html` and `css/style.css` for each level, crafting unique scenes based on user requests, like a cozy sunlit room and a modern airport security hall.\n\n\n**Designing Immersive Environments**\n\nNow, I'm working to create several immersive environments in `index.html` and `css/style.css`. I'm detailing specific scenes, like a departure lounge with navy blue chairs, golden gate pillars, and a clear view of an airliner. Each level will get its own unique look, like an airplane cabin with plush seats, window views of bright clouds, and a dreamy blue sky with pastel shapes. Plus, I'm integrating the user's uploaded image as HD backdrops that sit right beneath the UI.\n\n\n**Implementing Visual Enhancements**\n\nI'm now implementing juicy 3D bevels, glassmorphism overlays, and glowing hints. Character stickers and stage indicators with golden crowns and progress bars are being added. I'm focusing on dynamic wallpaper slice loading in `js/app.js` for `media_1787717941080`. I'm also adding particle effects. Screen-specific immersive themes are being integrated in `css/style.css`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   CÙNG BÉ BIN ĐI MÁY BAY - RICH COLORFUL 3D TYCOON DESIGN SYSTEM\n   - Lấy cảm hứng trực tiếp từ Bộ Background 8 Màn Chơi rực rỡ & Airport BillionAir\n   - Tươi sáng, độ bão hòa cao, bo tròn đồ chơi, viền đáy 3D đậm, đổ bóng đa tầng\n   - Mô hình Parent-Co-Play: Chữ to rõ ràng $\\ge 22px$, giao diện tương tác cực đại\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --color-sky-blue: #29B6F6;\n    --color-sky-deep: #0288D1;\n    --color-sun-yellow: #FFD54F;\n    --color-sun-orange: #FF9800;\n    --color-candy-red: #FF5252;\n    --color-candy-red-deep: #D50000;\n    --color-mint-green: #69F0AE;\n    --color-emerald: #00E676;\n    --color-royal-blue: #1976D2;\n    --color-purple: #BA68C8;\n    --color-warm-wood: #8D6E63;\n    --text-dark: #1A237E;\n    --text-muted: #455A64;\n    --shadow-chunky: 0 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16), 0 16px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n    --shadow-glow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 213, 79, 0.8);\n    --radius-toy: 32px;\n    --radius-round: 9999px;\n}\n\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    user-select: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none;\n}\n\nbody, html {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: 'Nunito', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4FC3F7 0%, #81D4FA 35%, #FFE082 70%, #FF8A65 100%);\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n#app-root {\n    width: 100vw;\n    height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n#effects-canvas {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TOP BAR: 8 STAGE ICONS RỰC RỠ & CỔNG BA MẸ\n   ========================================================================== */\n.top-nav {\n    height: 68px;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    z-index: 50;\n}\n\n.stage-indicators {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n    border: 3px solid #FFF;\n}\n\n.stage-dot {\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -4px 0 #CFD8DC;\n    border: none;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.active {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFEB3B 0%, #FFC107 100%);\n    transform: scale(1.2);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.5), inset 0 -4px 0 #FF8F00;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.completed {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #69F0AE 0%, #00E676 100%);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -4px 0 #00BFA5;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.locked {\n    opacity: 0.4;\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    filter: grayscale(0.8);\n}\n\n/* NÚT BẤM BILLIONAIR 3D CHUNKY */\n.tycoon-btn {\n    min-width: 60px;\n    min-height: 52px;\n    padding: 10px 22px;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 12px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n    transition: all 0.12s ease;\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:active {\n    transform: translateY(5px);\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-primary {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFD54F 0%, #FFA000 100%);\n    color: #4E342E;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #E65100, 0 12px 22px rgba(230, 81, 0, 0.35);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-primary:active {\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #E65100;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-green {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #69F0AE 0%, #00E676 100%);\n    color: #004D40;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #00897B, 0 12px 22px rgba(0, 137, 123, 0.35);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-green:active {\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #00897B;\n}\n\n/* Cổng Ba Mẹ: Vòng giữ 3 giây */\n.parent-gate-btn {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    transform: rotate(-90deg);\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring circle {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: #FF5722;\n    stroke-width: 5;\n    stroke-dasharray: 175;\n    stroke-dashoffset: 175;\n    transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.1s linear;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC (PARENT PROMPT SIGNBOARD)\n   - Chữ to $\\ge 22px$, dễ đọc trong 2 giây, rực rỡ phong cách BillionAir\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-prompt-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    margin: 4px auto 10px auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    z-index: 40;\n}\n\n.parent-prompt-signboard {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FFFDE7 100%);\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    padding: 12px 24px;\n    border: 4px solid #FFCA28;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #FFA000, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.prompt-icon-badge {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    animation: gentle-sway 2.5s infinite;\n}\n\n.prompt-speech-text {\n    font-size: 23px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1A237E;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   SCREENS VIEWPORT & THEMED BACKGROUNDS (8 MÀN CHƠI)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.screens-viewport {\n    flex: 1;\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: calc(100vh - 150px);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.screen {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    transform: scale(0.96) translateY(20px);\n    transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.25, 0.64, 1), visibility 0.35s;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 6px 16px 20px 16px;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    border-radius: 36px;\n}\n\n.screen.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: scale(1) translateY(0);\n}\n\n/* GIAO DIỆN THEMED NỀN RỰC RỠ TỪNG MÀN */\n#screen-1 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #FFF9C4 0%, #FFE082 50%, #FFCC80 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-2 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #FFF3E0 0%, #FFE0B2 50%, #FFAB91 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-3 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #E0F7FA 0%, #B2EBF2 50%, #80DEEA 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-4 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #E1F5FE 0%, #B3E5FC 50%, #81D4FA 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-5 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #E8EAF6 0%, #C5CAE9 50%, #9FA8DA 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-6 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #E1F5FE 0%, #81D4FA 50%, #29B6F6 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-7 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #EDE7F6 0%, #D1C4E9 50%, #B39DDB 100%);\n}\n\n#screen-8 {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #FFFDE7 0%, #FFF59D 50%, #FFE082 100%);\n}\n\n/* LỚP BACKDROP HÌNH ẢNH CROP THỰC TẾ */\n.screen.has-bg-slice {\n    background-size: cover !important;\n    background-position: center !important;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI (TỦ ĐỒ GỖ VÀNG TOY)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.wardrobe-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.wardrobe-cabinet {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFE082 0%, #FFCA28 100%);\n    border: 6px solid #FFA000;\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    padding: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #E65100, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 96px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    border: 3px solid #FFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #CFD8DC, 0 10px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.clothes-tile:active {\n    cursor: grabbing;\n    transform: scale(1.18) rotate(4deg);\n    z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.bin-avatar-card {\n    width: 200px;\n    height: 280px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 38px;\n    border: 6px solid #FFCA28;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #FFA000, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 14px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.bin-slot-item {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU (VALI ĐỎ DÁN HÌNH GẤU)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.suitcase-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 880px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.suitcase-box-red {\n    width: 280px;\n    height: 300px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF5252 0%, #D50000 100%);\n    border-radius: 38px;\n    border: 6px solid #8E0000;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 0 #5f0000, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.suitcase-inner-grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    flex: 1;\n    background: #FFCDD2;\n    border-radius: 26px;\n    border: 3px dashed #B71C1C;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-items: center;\n}\n\n.suitcase-bear-badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 12px;\n    right: 12px;\n    font-size: 44px;\n    animation: gentle-pulse 2s infinite;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH (BILLIONAIR SECURITY PODS)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.security-station-grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.station-pod {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    border: 4px solid #B3E5FC;\n    padding: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #81D4FA, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.boarding-pass-chunky {\n    width: 160px;\n    height: 95px;\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 3px dashed #FFB300;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    padding: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.boarding-pass-chunky:active {\n    transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-3deg);\n}\n\n.stamp-badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(0);\n    border: 4px solid #00E676;\n    color: #00E676;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.stamp-badge.stamped {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(1.15);\n}\n\n.xray-screen-neon {\n    width: 180px;\n    height: 110px;\n    background: #00251A;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    border: 3px solid #00E676;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.5);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 6px;\n}\n\n.xray-tap-box {\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 48px;\n    background: #00E676;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #00E676;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.xray-tap-box:active {\n    transform: scale(1.2);\n}\n\n.gate-detector-chunky {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 180px;\n    border: 14px solid #78909C;\n    border-bottom: none;\n    border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: rgba(236, 239, 241, 0.6);\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.gate-lamps-row {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -22px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.gate-lamp-led {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #CFD8DC;\n    border: 2px solid #546E7A;\n}\n\n.gate-lamp-led.green-flash {\n    background: #00E676;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px #00E676;\n    animation: lamp-blink 0.25s alternate 6;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY & NỐI VÉ ĐA NHÂN VẬT\n   ========================================================================== */\n.boarding-hall-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 920px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.characters-queue-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.character-ticket-card {\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    border: 4px solid #E0E0E0;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #CFD8DC;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.character-ticket-card:active, .character-ticket-card.selected {\n    transform: scale(1.12);\n    border-color: #FFB300;\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #FFA000;\n}\n\n.character-ticket-card.connected {\n    border-color: #00E676;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    opacity: 0.75;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.gates-array-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.gate-pillar {\n    width: 125px;\n    height: 125px;\n    background: #263238;\n    color: #FFD54F;\n    border: 5px solid #455A64;\n    border-radius: 26px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #102027;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.gate-pillar:active {\n    transform: scale(1.1);\n}\n\n.gate-pillar.matched {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2E7D32 0%, #1B5E20 100%);\n    border-color: #00E676;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #004D40, 0 0 22px #00E676;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 5: HIỆP SĨ ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC (ROYAL BLUE CABIN SEATS)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.cabin-seat-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.seat-plush-box {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1976D2 0%, #0D47A1 100%);\n    border-radius: 38px;\n    border: 8px solid #0D47A1;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #002171, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    padding: 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.safety-sign-led {\n    background: #FF5252;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    transition: background 0.3s;\n}\n\n.safety-sign-led.green-safe {\n    background: #00E676;\n    color: #004D40;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px #00E676;\n}\n\n.knight-cape-icon {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50px;\n    font-size: 54px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(0.5);\n    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.knight-cape-icon.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scale(1);\n}\n\n.seatbelt-straps-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    height: 70px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.strap-left, .strap-right {\n    height: 46px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.strap-left {\n    background: #37474F;\n    width: 90px;\n    border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.buckle-insert {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -18px;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 30px;\n    background: #B0BEC5;\n    border: 3px solid #78909C;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.strap-right {\n    background: #37474F;\n    width: 90px;\n    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.buckle-receiver {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -18px;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 42px;\n    background: #90A4AE;\n    border: 3px solid #546E7A;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-buckled .strap-left {\n    transform: translateX(18px) !important;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-buckled .buckle-receiver {\n    background: #00E676;\n    border-color: #00BFA5;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH (OVAL AIRPLANE WINDOW)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.cloud-window-frame {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    height: 310px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #29B6F6 0%, #81D4FA 60%, #E1F5FE 100%);\n    border-radius: 44px;\n    border: 14px solid #ECEFF1;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), 0 12px 0 #CFD8DC, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 10px;\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    padding: 16px 26px;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border: 3px solid transparent;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile:active {\n    transform: scale(1.25);\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile.morphed {\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    border-color: #FFD54F;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #FFD54F;\n    animation: gentle-bounce 0.6s infinite alternate;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 7: MÓN QUÀ LỊCH SỰ\n   ========================================================================== */\n.etiquette-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.etiquette-card-chunky {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border: 4px solid #B3E5FC;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #81D4FA, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-options {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn {\n    width: 66px;\n    height: 66px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #FFF;\n    border: 3px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #B0BEC5;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn:active, .volume-emotion-btn.selected {\n    transform: scale(1.2);\n    border-color: #00E676;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #00BFA5;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 8: LẤY VALI & HUY HIỆU DỰ THƯỞNG (CAROUSEL)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.carousel-final-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.carousel-track-chunky {\n    width: 90%;\n    height: 160px;\n    border: 16px solid #455A64;\n    border-radius: 80px;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.carousel-suitcases-track {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 30px;\n    position: absolute;\n    animation: carousel-orbit 14s linear infinite;\n}\n\n.carousel-suitcases-track.paused {\n    animation-play-state: paused;\n}\n\n.carousel-bag-tile {\n    width: 78px;\n    height: 90px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 4px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.carousel-bag-tile:active {\n    transform: scale(1.3) translateY(-10px);\n}\n\n/* Modal Phần Thưởng Cuối */\n.golden-medal-modal {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.8);\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 580px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFDE7 0%, #FFF9C4 100%);\n    border-radius: 38px;\n    border: 8px solid #FFD54F;\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\n    padding: 26px;\n    text-align: center;\n    z-index: 200;\n    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.golden-medal-modal.show {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   CỔNG BA MẸ (PARENT CONTROL HUB)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-modal-overlay {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100vw;\n    height: 100vh;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    z-index: 999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.parent-modal-overlay.open {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n}\n\n.parent-control-card {\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    max-height: 88vh;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    padding: 24px;\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    border: 5px solid #FF8A65;\n}\n\n.parent-tip-box {\n    background: #FFF3E0;\n    border-left: 5px solid #FF9800;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #4E342E;\n}\n\n.level-jump-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n}\n\n.jump-btn {\n    padding: 8px;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    border: 2px solid #CFD8DC;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   KEYFRAME ANIMATIONS\n   ========================================================================== */\n@keyframes gentle-sway {\n    0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-3deg); }\n    50% { transform: rotate(3deg); }\n}\n\n@keyframes gentle-bounce {\n    0% { transform: translateY(0); }\n    100% { transform: translateY(-8px); }\n}\n\n@keyframes gentle-pulse {\n    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }\n    50% { transform: scale(1.12); }\n}\n\n@keyframes lamp-blink {\n    0% { opacity: 0.3; }\n    100% { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n@keyframes carousel-orbit {\n    0% { transform: translateX(0); }\n    100% { transform: translateX(-400px); }\n}\n\n.pop-in {\n    animation: popIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n@keyframes popIn {\n    0% { transform: scale(0.6); opacity: 0; }\n    100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n.hidden {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   RESPONSIVE OPTIMIZATIONS (MOBILE & TABLET)\n   ========================================================================== */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .wardrobe-arena, .suitcase-arena, .cabin-seat-arena, .etiquette-arena {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .security-station-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n    .parent-prompt-signboard {\n        padding: 8px 16px;\n    }\n    .prompt-speech-text {\n        font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .prompt-icon-badge {\n        font-size: 24px;\n    }\n    .character-ticket-card {\n        padding: 6px 8px;\n        font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .gate-pillar {\n        width: 80px;\n        height: 85px;\n        font-size: 18px;\n    }\n}\n","Description":"Cập nhật style.css với màu sắc rực rỡ và nền themed cho 8 màn chơi","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\css\\style.css","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update style.css with rich theme colors"}}]}
